                    "text": "            long maxMemory = Runtime.getRuntime().maxMemory();\n            // v1.2.3 round-44 (C4): the old formula maxMemory/16 yielded only\n            //   32MB on a 512MB-heap device \u2014 far below a useful size. New\n            //   formula: half the heap, clamped to [16,128], then rounded down\n            //   to a 16MB multiple (the Math.max(16,...) above guarantees >=16).\n            long halfHeapMB = maxMemory / 2 / (1024 * 1024);\n            long optimalHashMB = Math.max(16, Math.min(128, halfHeapMB));\n            optimalHashMB = (optimalHashMB / 16) * 16;\n\n            Log.i(TAG, \"Hardware detection: processors=\" + availableProcessors\n                    + \" (bigCores=\" + bigCoreCount + \")\"\n                    + \" -> threads=\" + optimalThreads\n                    + \", maxMemory=\" + (maxMemory / 1024 / 1024) + \"MB\"\n                    + \" -> hash=\" + optimalHashMB + \"MB\");"
                  },
                  "endColumn": 59,
                  "endLine": 237,
                  "startColumn": 13,
                  "startLine": 224
                },
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/main/java/com/Regalia/EngineConfigHelper.java"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
